Z||000000||Gokart||08-27-2000||10:06 PM||||      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ag27$014_1.jpg">    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ag27$016_1.jpg">            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ag27$015_1.jpg">        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ag27$007_1.jpg">      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ag27$011_1.jpg">    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ag27$008_1.jpg">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ag27$002.jpg">       <P><p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 08-27-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Gokart||08-27-2000||10:28 PM||||The first pic is Bob's barn where all the Fiero animals dig and play! Gokart'sgirl is trying to sneak out of the pic after drooling on Boomtastic's Prostreet <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> The second is my stuff. I didn't leave a millionaire but got a brand new trunk gasket and Fisher body tabs for a trade with Bob! Fiero Wayne is the third picture. He was the biggest vendor there. Bob is on the far left. The next three are pics of the Fieros lined up on the side of Bob's house and the last is as many of the 20+ Fieros I could fit in the picture. It's the parking lot at the restaurant Saturday night! It was a great time and I hope we get back together soon. THANKS BOB PARKER <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P><p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 08-27-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||TheFiero64||08-28-2000||10:39 AM||||It was one great time.<BR>Here is a link to my pics <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=36282&a=8396293" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=36282&a=8396293</A> <P>Here is a link to Bob Schlag's pics <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=34313&a=8401398" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=34313&a=8401398</A> <BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif"> ||||reg||10
Z||000003||Gokart'sGirl||08-28-2000||11:38 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Gokart:<BR><B>Gokart'sGirl is trying to sneak out of the pic after drooling on Boomtastic's Prostreet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Just following your lead my love  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  What a great time we had.  So many great cars and wonderful folks.  It was so nice to finally put some faces with the names. I really enjoyed chatting with Bob S. from Fiero Pride. Fiero64, MattsFiero and their ladies - it was nice to meet some local Cape area folks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  I also enjoyed meeting Wayne (fierowayne) he's from Allentown,PA - ( I went to school right outside of Philly so I have a soft spot for Penn People.)  It was a treat to see Cobra and his lovely lady Jalopy Jo  - and the others from the first meeting in March.  Can't forget Boomtastic - his Pro Street drew quite a few droolers(myself included).  The best were Bob and Holly - they are amazing folks and made us all feel right at home.  It was nice to meet everyone and hope to see you all again real soon. <P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GokartsGirl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||11
Z||000004||Jaygee79||08-28-2000||08:08 PM||||It was great to finally meet everyone.  I had met some of you at the meeting back in March.  Everyone was so friendly!  I met so many people; Gokart, Gokart'sGirl, Phil, Boomtastic, Ray....I can't even name them all there were so many LOL.  It was nice to see others from the Cape area.  I hope I get to see you all again at the next event.||||reg||1
